## Authorized Use & Legal Disclaimer

This project is intended for **authorized security testing**, bug bounty
research, quality assurance, and defensive engineering only. You may use it
only against:

- systems you own;
- systems you have explicit written permission to test;
- authorized bug bounty / pentest engagements with safe-harbor scope;
- your own applications and lab environments.

Use against systems without authorization is illegal and is not supported by
this project. The maintainers assume no liability for misuse. Some pillars
(bot bypass, decryption/reverse engineering) must be applied only within
authorized scope and are provided for research/QA, not for abuse, scraping,
spam, or defeating protections you do not own or are not authorized to test.
